        {
          "fact_id": "coverage_adjustment",
          "fact": "For cross-vocabulary comparison on the shared raw distribution, raw-distribution accuracy is the in-vocabulary accuracy multiplied by answer-space coverage because an OOV row is necessarily incorrect under a closed answer set.",
